{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>I was made for this!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your friend got an abandoned old bus. He asks for your help in converting it into a cafe. <strong>Can you handle it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/GetABus_Super_Optimized.gif?t=1750685051\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Best job i've ever had!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean up, wash away all the dirt, break up the old junk and <strong>create something beautiful out of this nightmare!</strong> Consider the requests of the customers, everyone will want to add their unique desires to your list of tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/FlipIt_Super_Optimized.gif?t=1750685051\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How about some coffee?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can transform a bus into anything, even into a <strong>CAFE</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/MakeAcafe_Super_Optimized.gif?t=1750685051\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Jack of all trades \ud83d\ude0e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or even into a <strong>REAL motorhome!</strong> Wow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/OrAMotorhome_Super_Optimized.gif?t=1750685051\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Great and small</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free to make creative decisions on the conversion of buses and minivans to suit various needs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/GetCreative_Super_Optimized.gif?t=1750685051\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cheque, please!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a worthy reward for your actions and <strong>make your dreams come true!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/MakeMoney_Super_Optimized.gif?t=1750685051\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2174560?t=1750685051","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/b54568c23c27e12a0859eda1fef59b9f640aa606/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750685051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/c874c880038845011bbf3587be332bfa0f3d88b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750685051","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/c874c880038845011bbf3587be332bfa0f3d88b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750685051","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3736920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>I was made for this!</strong></h